          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Evidence, Politics, and the Class Size Debate",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Eric Hanushek’s chapter in The Class Size Debate (2002), edited by Lawrence Mishel and Richard Rothstein, pages 37–65. It critiques class-size evidence and broad reduction policies.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
